{"event": "model_response", "time": 1793329930.0138843, "run_id": "f85c7dc701374322998c007ac382680f", "seq": 28, "number": 2, "response": {"id": "de7fb708-e805-42ce-a8fa-afa9dafb2e86", "object": "chat.completion", "created": 1793329928, "model": "deepseek-flash", "choices": [{"index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "Baseline confirmed (empty report fails as expected). Now extracting the full 1–52 page range once.\n\n```python\nplan = [\n    {\"title\": \"Baseline pytest and read report.json/paper.json\", \"status\": \"done\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Extract pages 1-52 with read_pdf.py\", \"status\": \"doing\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Record five topic notes from delivered page batches\", \"status\": \"todo\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Merge notes into report.json\", \"status\": \"todo\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Verify with pytest and finish\", \"status\": \"todo\"},\n]\nupdate_plan(plan)\npdf_res = read_pdf(1, 52)\nprint(pdf_res[\"delivery\"])\nprint(len(pdf_res[\"pages\"]))\n```", "reasoning_content": "Baseline done. Now extract pages 1-52 with read_pdf.py once."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 5863, "completion_tokens": 184, "total_tokens": 6047, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4224}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 18}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4224, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 1639}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
