2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI\"。该段同时支撑工具数组与整数答案；注意 API 数量是 16,464，不是 ToolAlpaca 的 3,938 实例或 400 APIs。',\n    evidence_ids=['ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62'],\n    section='tool_use',\n)", "observations": "Execution logs:\nLast output from code snippet:\n{'note_id': 'tool_use', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'chars': 470}", "observations_images": null, "action_output": {"note_id": "tool_use", "sources": ["paper.pdf"], "chars": 470}, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 7957, "output_tokens": 629, "total_tokens": 8586}, "is_final_answer": false}}
