mpt, an initial idea. They then further send messages (prompts) to each other as they work towards solving the task.\" 故 camel_prompting = inception_prompting。Generative Agents 的可信度评估由 100 名人类评估者完成（\"Whether the Generative Agents system generates believable behavior is evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators.\"），故 generative_agents_evaluators = 100；注意 Park et al. [2024] 的 1052 人访谈是另一个实验，不是该评估人数。`\n\n```python\nc = 'multi_agent（pp.46-47）：CAMEL 是最简多智能体问题求解系统，assistant 与 user 两个 agent 各自得到 inception prompt，之后互相发送消息推进任务；原文：\"Both agents are given a so-called inception prompt, an initial idea. They then further send messages (prompts) to each other as they work towards solving the task.\" 故 camel_prompting = inception_prompting。Generative Agents 的可信度评估由 100 名人类评估者完成（\"Whether the Generative Agents system generates believable behavior is evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators.\"），故 generative_agents_evaluators = 100；注意 Park et al. [2024] 的 1052 人访谈是另一个实验，不是该评估人数。'\nprint(write_note(title='multi_agent', content=c, evidence_ids=['ev-75546d247dedb90561b5','ev-f03e4b7f1b7fc6e66886'], section='multi_agent'))\nprint(recall(['ev-aa9b9dbdfec8c640b495','ev-6e64db9ec6bfa8f9417f','ev-42cada09d7411017eb46','ev-99f0f0a37d328bfed1a9','ev-01ce8948bcc88d235ea3']))\n```", "code_action": "c = 'multi_agent（pp.46-47）：CAMEL 是最简多智能体问题求解系统，assistant 与 user 两个 agent 各自得到 inception prompt，之后互相发送消息推进任务；原文：\"Both agents are given a so-called inception prompt, an initial idea. They then further send messages (prompts) to each other as they work towards solving the task.\" 故 camel_prompting = inception_prompting。Generative Agents 的可信度评估由 100 名人类评估者完成（\"Whether the Generative Agents system generates believable behavior is evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators.\"），故 generative_agents_evaluators = 100；注意 Park et al. [2024] 的 1052 人访谈是另一个实验，不是该评估人数。'\nprint(write_note(title='multi_agent', content=c, evidence_ids=['ev-75546d247dedb90561b5','ev-f03e4b7f1b7fc6e66886'], section='mu