pts) to each other as they work towards solving the task.\" 故 camel_prompting = inception_prompting。Generative Agents 的可信度评估由 100 名人类评估者完成（\"Whether the Generative Agents system generates believable behavior is evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators.\"），故 generative_agents_evaluators = 100；注意 Park et al. [2024] 的 1052 人访谈是另一个实验，不是该评估人数。\nModel-authored note outlook, sources=['paper.pdf']:\noutlook（pp.50-52）：Table 4（p.51）列出五个研究议题 Training Data、Hallucination、Agent Behavior、Self reflection、Safety，即 training_data / hallucination / agent_behavior / self_reflection / safety；行内连续原文（合并空白）：“Training Data Finetune with inference time reasoning data Convergent/stable reinforcement learning VLA, Multimodal signals, such as speech Hallucination Use Self Verification Use Mechanistic Interpretability Use Open Ended/Open World Models for exploration Agent Behavior Scalable simulation infrastructure, role playing Distill reasoning to small models Models of agent and human behavior, emergent behavior, future of society Self reflection In-model self reflection and metareasoning Metacognition, personality Automated Scientific Discovery Safety Assistants: Responsibility, liability Privacy, fairness of data Wider application areas for assistants Table 4. Summary of Research Agenda for Agentic LLM”。结论（p.52）：“Robotic interaction and tool-use build on grounded retrieval augmentation, social interaction (such as theory of mind) builds on self reflection, and all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification.” 故 shared_foundations = reasoning, self_verification（基础是 reasoning，self-verification 支撑各类别）。\nEvidence ev-d2b420a2b23cdc8166d3 | paper.pdf | page:10 | sha256=b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c\n1:10   •   Plaat, Van Duijn, Van Stein, Preuss, Van der Putten & Batenburg\n\n\n       Approach                                             Reasoning Technology                Acting/Assistant                     Interacting\n       WorldGPT [Ge et 