{"event": "tool_call", "time": 1793330284.4764082, "run_id": "f85c7dc701374322998c007ac382680f", "seq": 491, "tool": "write_note", "arguments": {"title": "reasoning", "content": "reasoning（pp.10-11）：Self Consistency 从多条采样推理路径中按多数投票（majority voting）确定最终答案，而不是只取一条链；Tree of Thoughts 在思维树上的两种搜索控制器是 breadth_first_search 与 depth_first_search（广度优先与深度优先）。区别：SC 是输出层的集成选择规则，ToT 则把搜索过程显式建模为树上的状态探索，二者都不同于单条 Chain-of-Thought。", "evidence_ids": ["ev-0aaa960f62d9cf1689f1"], "section": "reasoning"}}
