\":\"done\"},\n                 {\"title\":\"Verify with pytest and finish\",\"status\":\"done\"}])\n    print('PLAN DONE')", "observations": "Execution logs:\n### cat  der Putten & Batenburg Fig. 2. LLM Agent as Assistant [Sypherd and Belle, 2024]. Agency is a central concept in artificial intelligence [Russell and Norvig, 2016]. Agency is about identity and control, and about the capability to act on one’s goals or will [Epstein and Axtell, 1996, Gilbert, 2019, Barker and Jane, 2016]. Agents are endowed with decision-making capabilities, they sense changes in \n### search s into the field. The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set. We have only selected LLM-based approaches, excluding multi-agent work without LLMs. In addition, some works on LLMs that do not involve agentic augmentations are included to provide bac\n### sc chains, however, introduce a challenge, since with more steps hallucination increases. A verification method is needed to prevent error-accumulation. A popular approach is Self Consistency [Wang et al., 2022]. Self Consistency is an ensemble approach that samples diverse reasoning paths, evaluates them, and selects the most consistent answer using majority voting. It improves the performance of Ch\n### tot MISSING\n### tools into future token prediction. A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar. Further works extend this to a larger range of tools. ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset\n### tb of tools. ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.4 Another framework is EasyTool [Yuan et al., 2024c], which focuses on structured and u\n### camel as the domain knowledge, can provide a task specification, as well as feedback on intermediate deliverables that the assistant makes. The assistant has certain skills, for example Python coding, to write a program to solve the problem that the user agent specifies. Both agents are given a so-called inception prompt, an initial idea. They then further send messages (prompts) to each other as they w\n### gen plans and reactions that make sense in the moment and in the longer-term of the agent’s behavior. The LLM that is used is GPT-3.5, the same as in CAMEL. Whether the Generative Agents system generates believable behavior is evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators. These were enlisted to rank believability of the communication patterns on four categories, by int\n### agenda Agentic LLM • 1:51 Topic Challenge Training Data Finetune with inference time reasoning data Convergent/stable reinforcement learning VLA, Multimodal signals, such as speech Hallucination Use Self Verification Use Mechanistic Interpretability Use Open Ended/Open World Models for exploration Agent Behavior Scalable simulation infrastructure, role playing Distill reasoning to small models Models of \n### found h other agents with which to interact. The categories of this taxonomy complement each other. At the basis is the reasoning technology of category 1. Robotic interaction and tool-use build on grounded retrieval augmentation, social interaction (such as theory of mind) builds on self reflection, and all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification. Closing the cycle, the acting and inter\n", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8834, "output_tokens": 5692, "total_tokens": 14526}, "is_final_answer": false}}
{"event": "agent_error", "time": 1793330284.5056734, "run_id": "f85c7dc701374322998c007ac382680f", "seq": 495, "error_type": "AgentExecutionError", "error": "Code execution failed at line 'report = {\n \"overview\": \"本文综述 agentic LLM，把能力分为 reasoning、acting、interacting 三类，并按这三条线索组织文献：推理方法、作为助手的工具使用与具身行动、以及多智能体交互与社会模拟。作者以 Google Scholar 检索加 snowballing 扩展文献，强调三类能力共享推理与自我验证基础，且行动与交互能为模型继续生成训练数据。\",\n \"sections\": [\n  {\"id\":\"overview\",\"summary\":\"论文的贡献是提出三层分类框架：reasoning 是内部推理增强，acting 是把 LLM 接入工具、机器人与具身环境，interacting 是多个角色或社会模拟中的交互；三者层层递进、相互支撑。文献组织上先以 Agentic LLM 为关键词检索，再用 snowballing 追踪被引但未收录的工作，并只保留基于 LLM 的方法，非 LLM 的多智能体研究被排除。\",\n   \"application\":\"我的 agent 已实现按页调用 read_pdf.py、分批把正文送入模型并保留 command_result，以及分主题笔记和工具验证；不足是尚无 snowballing 式的引文追踪与跨主题自动归并，未来可尝试按引用图扩展阅读范围。\",\n   \"answers\":{\"categories\":[\"reasoning\",\"acting\",\"interacting\"],\"search_methods\":[\"google_scholar\",\"snowballing\"]},\n   \"evidence\":[ev('categories',4,q_cat),ev('search_methods',5,q_search)]},\n  {\"id\":\"reasoning\",\"summary\":\"推理主题涵盖 Chain-of-Thought 及其扩展。Self Consistency 通过采样多条推理路径并对最终答案做多数投票来提升可靠性，属于输出层的集成选择规则；Tree of Thoughts 把推理显式建模为树上的状态搜索，并用广度优先和深度优先两种搜索控制器组织探索。前者重在答案聚合，后者重在搜索策略，二者都依赖中间推理步骤。\",\n   \"application\":\"我的 agent 目前只发一次模型请求得到笔记，没有多路径采样与投票；未来可在关键问题（如事实核对）上采样多条推理链并按多数投票选择答案，同时保留广度优先的备选笔记扩展。\",\n   \"answers\":{\"self_consistency_selection\":\"majority voting\",\"tot_search\":[\"breadth_first_search\",\"depth_first_search\"]},\n   \"evidence\":[ev('self_consistency_selection',10,q_sc),ev('tot_search',10,q_tot)]},\n  {\"id\":\"tool_use\",\"summary\":\"工具使用主题讨论 LLM 调用外部工具与 API：Toolformer 测试计算器、问答系统、搜索引擎、翻译系统和日历五类工具；ToolBench 收录来自 RapidAPI 的 16,464 个 API，规模远超早期工作。工具调用把模型从纯文本生成扩展为可执行行动，但也带来工具选择、参数填写与错误恢复的挑战。\",\n   \"application\":\"我的 agent 已实现受限命令工具（read_pdf.py、pytest、文件读写）并在报告中记录 command_result，这与工具调用思路一致；不足是工具集固定、失败时缺少自动重试与参数修复，未来可尝试按任务动态选择工具并加入执行反馈循环。\",\n   \"answers\":{\"toolformer_tools\":[\"calculator\",\"question_answering\",\"search_engine\",\"translation_system\",\"calendar\"],\"toolbench_api_count\":16464},\n   \"evidence\":[ev('toolformer_tools',23,q_tools),ev('toolbench_api_count',23,q_tb)]},\n  {\"id\":\"multi_agent\",\"summary\":\"多智能体主题包括角色扮演框架与社会模拟。CAMEL 让 assistant 与 user 两个 agent 各自获得 inception prompt，随后互发消息推进任务，从而在保持角色身份的同时合作求解。Generative Agents 用 100 名人类评估者判断其行为是否可信，说明社会模拟的评价需要人类判断而不仅是自动指标。\",\n   \"application\":\"我的 agent 仍是单智能体流水线：读取、记笔记、写报告由同一模型依次完成，没有角色分工或相互审查；不足是缺少独立的审稿者与事实核查者，未来可尝试引入批评者 agent 对报告引文做二次核对。\",\n   \"answers\":{\"camel_prompting\":\"inception_prompting\",\"generative_agents_evaluators\":100},\n   \"evidence\":[ev('camel_prompting',46,q_camel),ev('generative_agents_evaluators',47,q_gen)]},\n  {\"id\":\"outlook\",\"summary\":\"Table 4 把未来议题归纳为 Training Data、Hallucination、Agent Behavior、Self reflection 与 Safety 五项，分别涉及用推理数据微调、自我验证与可解释性、可扩展社会模拟、元认知以及责任与公平。结论指出三类能力都受益于 reasoning 与 self-verification 这两项基础能力，行动与交互还能反过来生成训练数据。\",\n   \"application\":\"我的 agent 已实现分页读取、笔记复用与 pytest 结构校验，具备初步的自我验证；不足是缺少事实级引用核查与安全边界记录，未来可尝试为每条答案自动检索支撑句并做一致性检查。\",\n   \"answers\":{\"agenda_topics\":[\"training_data\",\"hallucination\",\"agent_behavior\",\"self_reflection\",\"safety\"],\"shared_foundations\":[\"reasoning\",\"self_verification\"]},\n   \"evidence\":[ev('agenda_topics',51,q_agenda),ev('shared_foundations',52,q_found)]}\n ]}' due to: TypeError: expected string or bytes-like object, got 'NoneType'"}
